    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SEARCH ALL - BUDS</h2> is a game in the genre of &quot;hidden object&quot;, in which you need to find all the buds (flowers) on a large location. The buds (flowers) will be located in a variety of places, from the most prominent to barely noticeable places. The whole game location looks lively because of the animation elements. Find all the buds (flowers)! Don't let them go unnoticed :)<br><br><strong>Key Features:</strong><br>- Animation elements on location;<br>- 100 buds (flowers) to be found;<br>- Pleasant soundtrack;<br>- The gameplay can be interrupted at any time, and the game will automatically save the result;<br>- Implemented hints! If you find it difficult to find an item, use the hint!",
